  <Block BlockType="SubSystem" Name="Heat flow" SID="1247">
    <PortCounts out="1"/>
    <P Name="Position">[-70, 86, 5, 114]</P>
    <P Name="ZOrder">26290</P>
    <P Name="NameLocation">left</P>
    <P Name="ContentPreviewEnabled">on</P>
    <Mask>
      <Type>Continuous Multi-Step Signal</Type>
      <Display RunInitForIconRedraw="off">disp(&quot;Continuous&quot; + newline + &quot;Multi-Step&quot;)
</Display>
      <Description>This block generates a signal consisting of smoothly connected flat segments. Data points parameter takes an N-by-3 matrix where each row specifies a flat segment. First column and second column define start and end time of the segment, respectively. Third column defines the value of the segment. Second column can also be NaN to define a point value. Flat segments and point values are smoothly interpolated by Akima spline with the specified interpolation step.

For example, a matrix [0 1 5; 3 nan 9; 6 8 7] for Data points defines a signal as follows. First row defines a flat segment from t=0 to t=1 of value 5. Second row defines a point at t=3 of value 9. Third row defines a flat segment from t=6 to t=8 of value 7.</Description>
      <Initialization>
sig = SignalDesigner(&quot;ContinuousMultiStep&quot;);

% Initialization function can access parameter names directly
sig.XYData = dataPoints;
sig.DeltaX = deltaT;

update(sig)

SignalSourceBlockCallback.setDataToLookupTableBlock( ...
  SignalObject = sig, ...
  PathToBlock = [gcb &apos;/1-D Lookup Table&apos;]);
</Initialization>
      <MaskParameter Name="dataPoints" Type="edit">
        <Prompt>Data points</Prompt>
        <Value>[0 1 0]</Value>
      </MaskParameter>
      <MaskParameter Name="deltaT" Type="edit">
        <Prompt>Interpolation step [s]</Prompt>
        <Value>0.1</Value>
        <ConstraintName>constraint_deltaT</ConstraintName>
      </MaskParameter>
      <DialogControl Type="Group" Name="DescGroupVar">
        <Prompt>%&lt;MaskType&gt;</Prompt>
        <DialogControl Type="Text" Name="DescTextVar">
          <Prompt>%&lt;MaskDescription&gt;</Prompt>
        </DialogControl>
      </DialogControl>
      <DialogControl Type="Group" Name="ParameterGroupVar">
        <Prompt>Parameters</Prompt>
        <DialogControl Type="Edit" Name="dataPoints">
          <Prompt>Data points</Prompt>
          <ControlOptions PromptLocation="left"/>
        </DialogControl>
        <DialogControl Type="Edit" Name="deltaT">
          <Prompt>Interpolation step [s]</Prompt>
          <ControlOptions PromptLocation="left"/>
        </DialogControl>
      </DialogControl>
      <DialogControl Type="Text" Name="Control3">
        <Prompt>horizontal spacer 1</Prompt>
        <ControlOptions Visible="off"/>
      </DialogControl>
      <DialogControl Type="Text" Name="Control4">
        <Prompt>horizontal spacer 2</Prompt>
